Company sources, however, had contended that during buybacks, the current rules do not specify to considering debt on a consolidated basis and hence L&T had calculated its numbers on a stand-alone basis. The regulator, however, calculated L&T\xe2\x80\x99s total debt on a consolidated basis and rejected the buyback plan.


