Jaitley returned to the finance ministry after a successful kidney transplant and resumed in August his role as the government\xe2\x80\x99s main political spokesperson besides overseeing key programmes. He took part in several debates in Parliament and presided over the 32nd meeting of the GST Council. Fifty-four-year-old Piyush Goyal, who has been the party\xe2\x80\x99s treasurer, has seen his stature rise within the government after he was sworn in as a minister in May 2014. 

He was soon handed over charge of the crucial railway portfolio replacing Suresh Prabhu, who was moved to the commerce & industry ministry. The Mumbai politician is a trained chartered accountant and second-rank holder in law from Mumbai University. He was a well-known investment banker and has advised top corporates on management strategy and growth. He also served on the board of India\xe2\x80\x99s largest commercial bank, the State Bank of India, and Bank of Baroda, according to his website. Goyal\xe2\x80\x99s father Ved Prakash Goyal was also a veteran BJP leader and party treasurer. \xe2\x80\x9cGood economics makes for good politics. We are today at the cusp of a development explosion,\xe2\x80\x9d Goyal says on his website.

