But as the Vidarbha team entered the stadium on Wednesday morning, the batsmen must have felt much more calmed by another scene \xe2\x80\x93 that of the groundsmen shaving off grass from the pitch. The BCCI neutral curator Ashish Bhowmik \xe2\x80\x93 perhaps alarmed by the events of the last match \xe2\x80\x93 doesn\xe2\x80\x99t want the Ranji Trophy semifinal to be a three-day affair. 


