b'NEW DELHI: The railways will undertake another mega recruitment drive in two phases to hire nearly 2.30 lakh employees in the next two years and 10% of these jobs will be reserved for the economically weaker section (EWS), Union railway minister Piyush Goyal said on Wednesday. 


