b'CHENNAI: It seems there is a change of approach in Real Madrid. In a departure from their Galacticos philosophy of buying the current superstars, Real, these days, are looking to have future talent in their ranks. The young Vinicius Junior, Brahim Diaz, Marcos Llorente and Federico Valverde are now the vanguards of the transition under Santiago Solari and it has brought them results. 


