\xe2\x80\x9cThere is a very strong undercurrent as to how this should be made a bilateral issue,\xe2\x80\x9d said a Washington-based industry source aware of the companies\xe2\x80\x99 thinking. \xe2\x80\x9cThis has gone way beyond being a local (India) tussle.\xe2\x80\x9d

