What is CBI investigating?
The CBI\xe2\x80\x99s charge is that ICICI Bank sanctioned credit facilities of Rs 3,250 crore to Videocon group companies \xe2\x80\x94 Trend Electronics, Century Appliances, Kail, Value Industries and Evan Fraser & Co. On September 7, 2009, the bank disbursed Rs 300 cr to Videocon International and the next day a company originally floated by Dhoot, transferred Rs 64 crore into NuPower Energy a company floated by Chanda Kochhar\xe2\x80\x99s spouse 

  Deepak Kochhar
 + .


