b'NEW DELHI: In fairly unprecedented remarks, Union minister Arun Jaitley cautioned the CBI against \xe2\x80\x9cinvestigative adventurism\xe2\x80\x9d on Friday, a day after the agency named a string of top bankers in an FIR lodged against former ICICI Bank CEO and MD Chanda Kochhar, her husband Deepak Kochhar and Videocon Group MD Venugopal Dhoot.


\xe2\x80\x9cSitting thousands of kilometres away, when I read the list of potential targets in the ICICI case, the thought that crossed my mind was again the same \xe2\x80\x94 Instead of focusing primarily on the target, is a journey to nowhere (or everywhere) being undertaken? If we include the entire who\xe2\x80\x99s who of the banking industry \xe2\x80\x94 with or without evidence \xe2\x80\x94 what cause are we serving or actually hurting,\xe2\x80\x9d Jaitley wrote in a blog.


