b'Bachelor of Journalism and Mass Communication(BJMC) is a 3 years Undergraduate course, giving opportunities to gain hands on experiences in the digital or print media and interact with eminent media personalities. There are numerous BJMC Institutes/Colleges/Universities mushrooming all over the Delhi National Capital Region(Delhi-NCR). These Institutes offers a good infrastructure- real and virtual studios, media software and a great learning environment. You can make your preferences of the BJMC Institutes/Colleges/Universities based on the infrastructure, placements, simulations, fee structures etc.








Admissions:


