Embarrassed by Kumaraswamy\xe2\x80\x99s outbursts, Congress leaders went into a damage-control mode. KPCC president Dinesh Gundu Rao said he would issue a show-cause notice to Somashekar. \xe2\x80\x9cIf there are any shortcomings in our government, they should discuss them with the CM or deputy CM G Parameshwara (of Congress). We will not tolerate such indiscipline,\xe2\x80\x9d he said.

