Hours later, Somashekar met Rao in his office to apologise. \xe2\x80\x9cI had no intention to cause embarrassment to our government or humiliate Kumaraswamy. I was only talking about the development works in my constituency. If anyone is hurt by my statement, I will apologise,\xe2\x80\x9d he said.

