Home minister M B Patil countered saying Congress had not gone to the doorstep of JD(S) only for power. \xe2\x80\x9cWe wanted secular parties to join hands and keep BJP away. Though we had 78 MLAs then, we still sacrificed the CM\xe2\x80\x99s post to ensure a secular government.\xe2\x80\x9d

