b'The 15th Finance Commission has completed nearly half its state visits and travels to Punjab on Tuesday. Its chairman N K Singh spoke to 
TOI about the challenges being faced by the states, including the impact that the recent announcements related to the farm sector may have on their finances. 
Excerpts:

A number of states have announced farm loan waivers and other measures. How do you view these announcements and does that make your task tougher?



                (function(){
                  var adContainer = '<div id="div-gpt-ad-1485328452682222244" data-size="fluid" data-adsslot="TOI/TOI_ROS/TOI_ROS_AS/TOI_ROS_AS_Mrec_MID_300" class="webonly alC"></div>';
