Inaugurating the plant here, Andhra Pradesh chief minister N Chandrababu Naidu urged the Kia Motors top brass as well as Korean ambassador Shin Bongkil to promote AP as the \xe2\x80\x9cgo-to\xe2\x80\x9d destination for investments in South Korea.

