\xe2\x80\x9cWe are in a better state, but it would have been good if the entire team was accommodated in hotels,\xe2\x80\x9d they said.

Officials also cited the cyclists\xe2\x80\x99 reluctance to stay in hotels. 

\xe2\x80\x9cMost of the hotels have refused to allow cycles in the room and these athletes will not let their cycles out of sight for even a minute,\xe2\x80\x9d organising secretary Ritesh Choudhary said. The players, they claim, have not asked for cots and seem to be quite happy with mattresses. When told about this, the cyclists only smiled.

Mukesh Kumar, who has won six national medals so far, agreed that staying away from their cycles was not an option. \xe2\x80\x9cOur cycles cost around Rs 5 lakh each and we cannot afford any damage to them,\xe2\x80\x9d he said. \xe2\x80\x9cEven a scratch is unbearable.\xe2\x80\x9d It is his personal cycle, bought with the money collected by his farmer father and school teacher mother.

Dev Kishan Saharan, who has two Asia Cup bronze to his name, differs. \xe2\x80\x9cIf I get a proper storage facility, I am willing to keep my cycles there,\xe2\x80\x9d he said.

The storage facility provided does not meet the expectations. So, apart from 30 cyclists, the hall allotted to Rajasthan also has 20 cycles. On Tuesday, Saharan moved out to a cousin\xe2\x80\x99s place. 

The Maharashtra girls have been accommodated in a hall that is almost of same size as the men\xe2\x80\x99s. However, space is not an issue for the six-member team. The problem, however, is the bathroom, which is some distance away.

'

b'NEW DELHI: Good news for mobile players of Fortnite. The battle royale game has got controller support now with the latest update. With this addition that Fortnite\xe2\x80\x99s patch 7.30 has brought, the smartphone players of the game may not feel disadvantaged now against PC and console players.

