b'Hyderabad: Being a master craftsman has its advantages \xe2\x80\x94 one can gain instant entry into the orbit of the famous. The lucky ones can even have a \xe2\x80\x98date\xe2\x80\x99 squeezed into the Prime Minister\xe2\x80\x99s hectic calendar.

Nearly 52 years after meeting India\xe2\x80\x99s first and only woman Prime Minister, Ghulam Khaleq Siddiqui continues to be \xe2\x80\x9cat a loss for words,\xe2\x80\x9d but feels honoured to have presented Indira Gandhi a Bidri goblet he crafted. 



