Chidambaram said the two words missing from the Budget were \xe2\x80\x9cjobs and education\xe2\x80\x9d, accusing the Modi regime of failing the country\xe2\x80\x99s youth and children. \xe2\x80\x9cThat is because if they say anything about jobs, the young will dismiss it as \xe2\x80\x98pakodanomics\xe2\x80\x99,\xe2\x80\x9d he said, in an allusion to PM Narendra Modi\xe2\x80\x99s earlier remark that selling \xe2\x80\x98pakodas\xe2\x80\x99 was also a job.

