Former India captain Sourav Ganguly is at the helm of affairs and Dalmiya is the secretary. There could be some cosmetic changes in other positions when the election comes.

While the BCCI is still waiting for the Supreme Court to announce the dates for the elections, the CoA has asked the apex court to make it mandatory for the state bodies to implement the Lodha reforms and thereupon take part in the board elections.

