\xe2\x80\x9cIt is not going to be a regular idol re-installation ceremony. It will be one of the grandest events in the world. Even the temple project is being developed in such a way that it becomes a symbol of culture and tradition for the next 1,000 or 2,000 years,\xe2\x80\x9d chief minister K Chandrasekhar Rao said on Sunday after inspecting the ongoing works at Yadagirigutta.

