The AIADMK is expected to contest not less than 24 seats, apportioning the rest for its allies that will include, besides the BJP, Ramadoss\xe2\x80\x99s PMK, Vijayakant\xe2\x80\x99s DMDK, G K Vasan\xe2\x80\x99s TMC, K Krishnaswamy\xe2\x80\x99s Puthiya Tamizhagam and educationist T R Pachamuthu\xe2\x80\x99s IJK, and a few other smaller outfits.

