What OPS did not reveal, and belying the aggressive posturing by senior leader and Lok Sabha deputy speaker M Thambi Durai and party spokesman C Ponnaiyan, is that the AIADMK and the BJP have long begun alliance talks. Chief minister Edappadi K Palaniswami\xe2\x80\x99s confidantes and heavyweight ministers S P Velumani and P Thangamani are said to be in touch with BJP president Amit Shah through his Tamil-speaking emissary and defence minister Nirmala Sitharaman, who makes frequent visits to Tamil Nadu for official events.

