Two weeks ago, the AIADMK announced the constitution of three committees to finalize alliances ahead of the Lok Sabha elections and draft the party\xe2\x80\x99s poll manifesto and campaign strategy. The crucial committee to discuss seat-sharing include Velumani and Thangamani, besides AIADMK deputy coordinators R Vaithilingam, K P Munusamy and organizing secretary J C D Prabakar. Munusamy and Prabakar are OPS loyalists.

