b'KOLKATA: Thirteen years after she ended her 26-day fast which, many believe, propelled her to Writers\xe2\x80\x99 Buildings, Mamata Banerjee, now a two-term chief minister, returned to Metro Channel on Sunday night to start another dharna, this time demanding an end to the \xe2\x80\x9cmisuse\xe2\x80\x9d of central agencies by the Narendra Modi government. It is Delhi, however, that she has in her sights now.


\xe2\x80\x9cThis is unprecedented. They are using some pretext to impose President\xe2\x80\x99s Rule in Bengal. This is nothing less than a coup, a super emergency,\xe2\x80\x9d she told journalists assembled there.


