Following the press conference, the drama shifted to Metro Channel in Esplanade, the same spot where she had gone on a 26-day-long hunger strike in 2006. On Sunday, she sat outside the Metro channel outpost from 8.45pm and was joined a host of senior party leaders and cops, including Kumar.

Cops began clearing a part of the road as labourers started erecting a platform. \xe2\x80\x9cI have received calls from several leaders across the country who have expressed their solidarity in this fight. I just spoke to Arvind Kejriwal and Chandrababu Naidu,\xe2\x80\x9d she said. 

