                  $('.top2brdiv').remove();
                  $('#fluid-container').append(adContainer);
                })()



        \xe2\x80\x9cHad the coalition government implemented Raitha Belaku, Congress would have been in a better position today to counter BJP at the hustings,\xe2\x80\x9d said BS Shivanna, KPCC general secretary and close confidant of Siddaramaiah. Another Siddaramaiah supporter, former minister HM Revanna, said, \xe2\x80\x9cWhen we talk about putting up a united fight against BJP, JD(S) has to look at the good work done by the previous Congress government and use it.\xe2\x80\x9d

However, finance department officials say the government cannot consider the Raitha Belaku scheme given the state\xe2\x80\x99s finances. Kumaraswamy is likely to peg the 2019-20 budget outlay at around Rs 2.4 lakh crore \xe2\x80\x94 up from Rs 2.2 lakh crore. While state revenue collection is on target, the dampener is the shortfall in central assistance.

